00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.740
My mom was actually
pretty strongly against me

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:36.150
being in the industry at first.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.070
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- Yeah. So I kind of always-

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:38.941
- [Mila] Oh my God.

