00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:49.500
It was kind of always a dream
of mine from a very young age,

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.600
even when I was like four or five.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.010
I wanted to do theater.
- [Kelly] Really?

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:54.810
- Yeah, I wanted to do
everything in school-

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.640
- Did something happen that you like...

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.139
I remember I saw a musical

00:00:58.139 --> 00:01:00.630
and I was like, 'Oh my gosh",

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:01.625
like this is what I'm meant to do.

00:01:01.625 --> 00:01:02.682
