that's what made me.

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:09.450
I was like a sophomore in high school.

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:10.860
I was like, "Oh my God,
I must do something

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:11.940
like this in my life."

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:12.960
So was there something that happened

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:14.340
