little? Does your mom know?

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.770
Like, I'm just curious how,
you know, like that early?

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:17.610
That's amazing.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:18.480
- I don't know.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.010
I don't have an exact answer.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:21.780
I can't like pinpoint a moment.

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:23.430
I mean, I was obsessed with musicals

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:24.600
when I was young as well.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:27.810
Like I loved "The Sound of
Music" and "Wizard of Oz"

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:29.250
and like "Chitty Chitty Bang Bang"

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:30.720
or like anything like that.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:31.553
- Solid Classics.

00:01:31.553 --> 00:01:32.386
- [Chara] Yes, yes.

00:01:32.386 --> 00:01:33.219
- [Kelly] All right.

00:01:33.219 --> 00:01:36.030
