from being like a little kid.

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:44.940
And my mom was surprised
because I guess, you know,

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:46.950
most kids get distracted
or they start crying,

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:49.500
but I would kind of be like
totally caught up in the screen.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:50.333
- [Kelly] Hyper-focused.

00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:51.570
- Yes so focused.

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:52.403
- Wow.

00:01:52.403 --> 00:01:53.910
- And I always wanted to do things

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:54.806
kind of in that performance element.

00:01:54.806 --> 00:01:56.580
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:00.127
- At school and everything.
But my mom was like,

00:02:00.127 --> 00:02:01.807
"You need to wait until you're 18,

00:02:01.807 --> 00:02:02.883
"You need to wait until you're older,

00:02:02.883 --> 00:02:04.950
'You need to have a normal childhood

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:06.870
