00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:08.143
- Well, it doesn't always
end well for child actors.

00:02:08.143 --> 00:02:09.240
- Yeah.
- [Kelly] That's why

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.440
she probably, there's, you know

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:11.670
sometimes it doesn't go well.

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:13.590
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:14.691
I'm here now.
- Yeah.

00:02:14.691 --> 00:02:16.623
- No, you're great.
That's what I'm saying.

00:02:16.623 --> 00:02:17.456
I wouldn't have said
it if it was the other-

00:02:17.456 --> 00:02:19.740
- I know, I was like,
"It's all turned terribly".

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:21.960
- No, it can be hard because
especially you're growing up

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:23.520
in a different generation than us.

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:25.514
Like it's already hard
enough to be a child actor,

00:02:25.514 --> 00:02:26.490
- [Mila] Much different.
- [Chiara] Stop it.

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:28.410
- No, I know, but I'm just
saying it's, it's different.

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:29.640
You're on, you're online.

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:32.160
Like it's a completely
different world of bullying.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:33.870
It's a completely different
world of growing up

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:35.760
in, in public, like everyone is.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.080
- Yeah.
- so it's kind of hard.

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:38.580
So, but I think you're amazing

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:40.650
for such a young, so young actor.

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:42.000
You started young as well.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.880
- I was nine.
- Yeah. Good God, you two.

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:47.070
- Yeah, I know.
- You Knew that early too.

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:49.140
- Oh my God, I, I was obsessed.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:50.130
- Well okay.

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:52.110
- Obsessed. I still love it.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:54.630
Like I've, you know, 30
years into it and I like

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:57.300
