on the Kelly Clarkson show.

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:05.340
Like it wouldn't exist.

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:06.874
Like I wouldn't be able to do it.

00:03:06.874 --> 00:03:07.860
You know what I mean?
- Yeah.

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:09.840
To sit here to be able to like,

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.510
it's incredible life. I've
been, I mean, honestly, like

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:13.419
I'm so grateful every single day.

00:03:13.419 --> 00:03:15.480
- (knocking on table) I'm
knocking for you (laughs).

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:17.340
- So you both play this same woman

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.590
at different points in her life

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:20.423
