00:03:20.423 --> 00:03:22.830
So let's take a look
at Chiara in the movie.

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:23.663
- Is it true?

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.940
I had no idea Arthur was
gonna do something like that.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:27.773
