(voice breaking) What
are people gonna say?

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:49.613
- Mom?

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.613
Mom?
- No, Tiffany.

00:03:54.717 --> 00:03:55.550
No, no.

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:57.903
You disgust me.

00:03:58.882 --> 00:04:00.407
